WEBVTT


00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.460
Hey guys welcome back to back to basics for Episode 5

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:06.381
where we're going to create a Power BI project file

00:00:06.382 --> 00:00:08.101
aka a PBI P

00:00:08.102 --> 00:00:12.561
Microsoft's new way of storing Power BI reports and semantic models

00:00:12.562 --> 00:00:14.861
for my semantic model I'm gonna click on file

00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:18.181
create new report and that's creating a report in the cloud

00:00:18.182 --> 00:00:22.081
which we'll need to save and I'm just gonna call it school data report

00:00:22.082 --> 00:00:24.901
so now that that's saved I'm going to download the file

00:00:24.902 --> 00:00:27.341
and open up the report in Power BI Desktop

00:00:27.342 --> 00:00:30.341
which you will need to have installed on your computer

00:00:30.342 --> 00:00:34.221
