Next we wanna make sure we have some preview settings enabled

00:00:45.621 --> 00:00:48.181
so we're gonna go to File Options and Settings

00:00:48.182 --> 00:00:49.161
Preview features

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:52.420
and make sure you have the Power BI project save option on

00:00:52.421 --> 00:00:54.781
you'll probably have to restart your Power BI desktop

00:00:54.782 --> 00:00:58.021
just FYI file save as school data report

00:00:58.022 --> 00:01:02.141
but we're gonna select the P bip file instead for the file type

00:01:02.142 --> 00:01:06.021
can even see up here that it's a Power BI project file now

00:01:06.022 --> 00:01:06.941
so on the back end

00:01:06.942 --> 00:01:10.501
we've got two files and a folder and the folder has more files in it

00:01:10.502 --> 00:01:14.281
everything stored in plain text versus one binary file

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:17.620
we all Know who loves plain text AI.

